# Law Gate: Mandatory AGENTS.md Compliance

In every session operating on the **FinESO** codebase, the agent **MUST**:
1. Read the contents of `AGENTS.md` at the repository root.
2. Strictly adhere to all Invariants defined in `AGENTS.md`.
3. All other rules and skills serve solely as complementary guidance; they must not contradict or override the laws established in `AGENTS.md`.
